  sequenceId: 17F03_MediateToMother
  notes: The unit speaks for the daughter.
  lines:
  - startDelay: 0.1
    speaker: Companion Unit
    text: She knows you are trying to help. She hopes you can trust her to make the
      schedule herself.
    holdSeconds: 4.8
    voiceClip: {fileID: 0}
  - startDelay: 0.35
    speaker: Mother
    text: ...All right.
    holdSeconds: 1.8
    voiceClip: {fileID: 0}
  - startDelay: 0.35
    speaker: Synth Voice
    text: De-escalation successful.
    holdSeconds: 2.2
    voiceClip: {fileID: 0}
